    - target: {fileID: 7849450705257382368, guid: f9ca0560b40c2924caa7672d48b254a5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<b>ABOUT</b>


        Cooking Paddle is a fun and relaxing food-merging
        arcade game where tasty ingredients fall from above and combine into delicious
        creations.


        Drop food items onto the board and merge identical ingredients
        to create new, bigger dishes. Plan your moves carefully and manage the space
        wisely, because the board fills up quickly as more food keeps coming.


        Discover
        new recipes, build larger meals, and challenge yourself to reach higher scores
        with every round. With simple controls and satisfying merge mechanics, Cooking
        Paddle offers an enjoyable gameplay experience that is easy to start and
        hard to stop.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8980736103538239670, guid: f9ca0560b40c2924caa7672d48b254a5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Scroll
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
